    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_paper2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "It was autumn at the time, and I was trekking through the barren wastes with a few Iberians who were fleeing their homeland.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "Just when we thought we were going to meet our ends there, the abbey appeared in front of us. It seemed like some sort of miracle, an act of divine intervention that couldn't be real.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "The venerable abbot, Bishop Torregrossa, took in those people who had nowhere to go. He was a respectable elder, most pious and devout in his ways.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "Under his management, this monastery, cut off from the rest of the land by the wilderness, became its own fantastical domain of sorts.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "Here, people whose lives would normally never intertwine lived in harmony, depending on one another. They lived in material poverty but not spiritual poverty, making no distinction between class, all putting their best feet forward to live life.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_925_1#6$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "text": "I knew it, this handwriting...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0.6,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_paper1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "When I made my request, the Abbot replied to me after an extended silence, saying that while he would not refuse aid to those in need, there was not much he could do, because of my distance.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "Maybe because I wasn't expecting much in the first place, I didn't feel too bad about being turned down. If anything, he seemed be more guilty and chagrined about turning down my unreasonable request than the person who made it in the first place.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "I am deeply gratified that there exists such a paradise for good people, but at the same time, I could not help but raise this one question:",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "Can this miracle, like a seed that refuses to adapt to the soil it is grown in, truly persist on this land?",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "Maybe I've been here a bit too long.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "It's about time I set out again, to Laterano.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$book_close"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_925_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "'People whose lives would normally never intertwine', 'making no distinction between class'...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_925_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, when I first saw the scene, I also doubted my eyes, a bit.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "text": "If I was speaking just for myself, I'd really hope this peace, rare as it is, could last forever.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$doorknockquite"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_925_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Come in.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_934_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1,
        "bstart": 0.2,
        "bend": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you busy, Seniora Lemuen?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Monastery Inhabitant"
    },
    {
        "text": "Remember that pattern you were talking about earlier? Some of the others tried embroidering it onto a quilt with me. How do you think it turned out?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Monastery Inhabitant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_925_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's see... Mm, hmm. Excellent craftsmanship. It wouldn't surprise me to find it on display in a store.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_934_1#1$1",
        "bstart": 0.2,
        "bend": 0.7
    },
    {
        "text": "You're exaggerating.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Monastery Inhabitant"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now that it's getting colder, the blankets you have with you might not be enough to keep you warm, so everyone pitched in some fabric.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Monastery Inhabitant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_925_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I appreciate the concern.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "text": "But if you give it to me, the others might not have enough? You should think about them first.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_925_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I know how I look, but I'm actually plenty tough. I don't get sick easily.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_934_1#1$1",
        "bstart": 0.2,
        "bend": 0.7
    },
    {
        "text": "Haha, don't worry about us. As long as everyone chips in, it's not a big deal.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Monastery Inhabitant"
    },
    {
        "text": "But, I must say, I'm not sure 'tough' is what comes to mind when I look at you. What's Laterano thinking these days, sending you so far away?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Monastery Inhabitant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_925_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, um, about that...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's a question I'd like to ask my superiors.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
