        "name": "avg_npc_927_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fortuna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_936_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_927_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "cameraeffect",
        "effect": "Grayscale",
        "fadetime": 0,
        "keep": true,
        "initamount": 0,
        "amount": 0.7,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_927_1#5$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why don't we go back?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fortuna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_936_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Because Raimund and the others can't go with us! Isn't that reason enough?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Delfina"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_936_1#6$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "You want to leave them behind? Well, I don't!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Delfina"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "cameraeffect",
        "effect": "Grayscale",
        "fadetime": 0,
        "amount": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_927_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "text": "(Stupid Fina, do you really think I'm that cold-blooded? Of course I'm not going to leave behind the people I grew up with.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fortuna"
    },
    {
        "text": "(But, we can just stay stuck like this forever either. Tempers have really been high lately...)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fortuna"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Is there no better solution?)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fortuna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_927_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "*sigh*...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fortuna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's wrong? What are you sighing for this time?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_931_1#11$2",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "That's odd... Why are you here by yourself? Delfina's not with you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Raimund"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$rungeneral",
        "volume": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_927_1#8$1",
        "posfrom": "200,0",
        "posto": "0,0",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_931_1#11$2",
        "duration": 0.3
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_931_1#11$2",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_927_1#8$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Raimund!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fortuna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_927_1#4$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's that supposed to mean? It's not like Delfina and I are stuck together!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fortuna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_931_1#9$2",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "You might as well be. You're close enough, just one step from sharing a bed.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Raimund"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_927_1#7$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "We do sleep together sometimes though... Hey wait, that's not the point!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fortuna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_927_1#3$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "When'd you get back anyway? I heard you went hunting with Senior Gerald. Any luck? Didn't get hurt, did you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fortuna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_927_1#10$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Make sure you let us know if you ever do get hurt. Don't be like Senior Gerald, who just toughs it out by himself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fortuna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_931_1#11$2",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm fine. I don't need you worrying over me for no reason.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Raimund"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_927_1#6$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "For no reason? Who's the one who said nothing until his wounds got inflamed? And who's the one who went down into the mines without permission and barely made it back?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fortuna"
    },
    {
        "text": "You\u2013",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fortuna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_931_1#6$2",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I know, I know, let's just say it was my fault, okay?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Raimund"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_927_1#6$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh? 'Let's just say'?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fortuna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_931_1#10$2",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "...It was my fault.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Raimund"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_931_1#8$2",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Raimund"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_931_1#1$2",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Fortuna.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Raimund"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_927_1#10$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fortuna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_931_1#10$2",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Actually, I came back because I wanted to ask you... and Delfina. And of course, the others as well.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Raimund"
    },
    {
        "text": "I wanted to ask... if you wanted to come with us...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Raimund"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "The young man stopped speaking halfway through."
    },
    {
        "text": "He suddenly falls silent."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_931_1#2$2",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Raimund"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_927_1#3$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Raimund?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fortuna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_931_1#8$2",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Never mind, it's no big deal.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Raimund"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_931_1#1$2",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I need to leave for a bit, and might not be back until late.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Raimund"
    },
    {
        "text": "Fortuna, can you come to the roof of the sacrarium before dinner?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Raimund"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_931_1#11$2",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Bring Delfina with you too... There's something I need to tell you two.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Raimund"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "39_g4_gatheringplace_d",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$sjoyasorrow_intro",
        "key": "$sjoyasorrow_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4015_spuria_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Let me take a look. What's going on here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Serpilia"
    },
    {
        "text": "They even built a road by the monastery? It stretches all the way to the edge of the city... Is it really so cramped inside? I personally think it's plenty spacious.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Serpilia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_372_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are there so many people here? It must be tough feeding a crowd that big... especially out in the barrens.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Richele"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1032_excu2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "See for yourself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1032_excu2_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Someone's coming.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4015_spuria_1#12$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmm? Oh, someone just walked out. Should be one of the residents?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Serpilia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_931_1#10$2",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Where'd Hyman run off to...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Raimund"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4015_spuria_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh? Salvus sis, hottie with a hidden face.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Serpilia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_931_1#6$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2013\u2013! Who's there?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Raimund"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_931_1#7$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Halos... You're Sankta.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Raimund"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't care who you people are, or what you're after, but you're not coming any closer!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Raimund"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_372_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's not jump right to drawing swords and crossbows. We only just met. Why don't we all take a deep breath and talk things through?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Richele"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_372_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Good afternoon, Senior. The three of us here are from Laterano, without any ill intent. No need to be so tense... I'd be pleased as punch if you'd lower your weapon.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Richele"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_931_1#1$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Raimund"
    },
    {
        "text": "What brings some Laterans all the way out to these remote mountains?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Raimund"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_372_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Um, we were sent by His Holiness in search of two compatriots.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Richele"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1032_excu2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're wasting your time, Richele.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "text": "It is clear to me that he knows exactly who we are and why we have come. He has hostile intent.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1032_excu2_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You clearly have strong animosity towards Laterano, judging from the displeasure on your face. From where does your hostility come?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_931_1#10$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "...I have no idea what you're talking about.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Raimund"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1032_excu2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You've been standing by the entrance to the side alley this whole time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_931_1#7$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "...?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Raimund"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1032_excu2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're deliberately trying to block our view. You don't want our attention there.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1032_excu2_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "So, what is in there?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_931_1#7$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who do you think you are\u2013",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Raimund"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4015_spuria_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Serpilia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "posfrom": "0,0",
        "posto": "-200,0",
        "afrom": 1,
        "ato": 0,
        "duration": 0.8
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_372_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright, Federico, there's no need to provoke the other side! Though, I'm sure that wasn't your intention.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Richele"
    },
    {
        "text": "You haven't forgotten the mission His Holiness gave us, right? Low key, low key. We can't afford to make a mess of things again.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Richele"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1032_excu2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I wasn't trying to provoke anyone.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_931_1#7$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hah, you Laterans are always like this. Showing up out of nowhere, making a mess out of everything.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Raimund"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1032_excu2_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Given the information we have, your situation wasn't looking good to begin with.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_931_1#7$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "...I dare you to say that again.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Raimund"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_931_1#5$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wanna fight? C'mon, I'll show you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Raimund"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4015_spuria_1#1$1",
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The air is awfully tense over there...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Serpilia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4015_spuria_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Federico has a way of drawing attention. And that makes light work of burglary.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Serpilia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4015_spuria_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But, that hooded guy over there... Ugh, something's not right here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Serpilia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4015_spuria_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Forget it, I'll figure out the math later.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Serpilia"
    },
    {
        "text": "First, I need to find our target.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Serpilia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4015_spuria_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Haha, let me guess where you might be, Lemuen.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Serpilia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "39_g2_abandonsancturay",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_490_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$darkness01_intro",
        "key": "$darkness01_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_490_1#1$1",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$dooropenquite"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_490_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Looks like no shortage of guests today.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arturia"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hello, Senior Gerald.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arturia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_926_1#1$2",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I thought I'd get to see Stefano here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gerald"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_490_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "His Excellency still has a lot of business to attend to. He just left.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arturia"
    },
    {
        "text": "He can't have gotten very far, so given your athleticism, I'm sure you could catch up to him.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arturia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_926_1#1$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thanks.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gerald"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gerald"
    },
    {
        "text": "I haven't heard you hitting the strings today.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gerald"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_490_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you enjoy the sound of my music, I don't mind playing something for you right now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arturia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_926_1#1$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll pass.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gerald"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_926_1#6$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm very grateful... for the joy you've been able to bring some of our people.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gerald"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_926_1#1$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "But not everyone finds comfort in your music. At least, I don't.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gerald"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_926_1#10$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can't imagine why a musician like you chooses to remain here... But I do hope you won't bring disaster upon us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gerald"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_490_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You think too highly of me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arturia"
    },
    {
        "text": "As far as I know, disasters have always been buried in the soil, from whence they take root, sprout, blossom, and bear fruit.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arturia"
    },
    {
        "text": "If such a seed exists in this garden, it will break through the soil sooner or later.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arturia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_490_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "And I... am simply a passerby, watching it all unfold.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arturia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_926_1#1$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "We have no seeds that ought not sprout.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gerald"
    },
    {
        "text": "Before long, everything will return to normal. There will be no accidents, let alone disasters.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gerald"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_926_1#9$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "All I ask, young lady, is that you don't do anything unnecessary.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gerald"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_490_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you giving advice?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arturia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_926_1#1$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "No.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gerald"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_926_1#5$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm giving you a warning.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gerald"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_490_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Such roundabout, insensitive words. Though, I suppose the fact that you haven't done anything means you're holding back, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arturia"
    },
    {
        "text": "I suppose that's to be expected, given the circumstances.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arturia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_490_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Hmm?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arturia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$dooropenquite",
        "volume": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_490_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh my.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arturia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_929_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_928_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_928_1#7$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Pretty...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Raggedly-Dressed Boy"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_929_1#6$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ma'am...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Raggedly-Dressed Girl"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_490_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Indeed, no shortage of guests today.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arturia"
    },
    {
        "text": "Please come in, my unexpected little visitors.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arturia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
