    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_372_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Okay, okay. Stop talking like that, Federico.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Richele"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1032_excu2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I didn't say anything wrong.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_372_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just stay quiet for now, alright?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Richele"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1032_excu2_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_372_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "And you, young man, let's not do anything rash. We really are just looking for one of our missing colleagues, and uh, whoever you might be, we mean you no harm.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Richele"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_931_1#7$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmph. You sure can talk.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Raimund"
    },
    {
        "text": "That bruiser of yours means me no harm?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Raimund"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1032_excu2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_372_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ahem, well, you have my word. Either way... could you please let us through? If you could tell the man in charge we're here, that would be ideal.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Richele"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_372_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Serpilia... Huh? Where did Serpilia go?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Richele"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1032_excu2_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "She's already inside.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_931_1#6$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh? When she\u2013?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Raimund"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1032_excu2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_931_1#7$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Gah! I can't let you Laterans run roughshod!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Raimund"
    },
    {
        "text": "Aren't you here to see the abbot? Come with me!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Raimund"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_372_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Haha... Great, does that mean you're letting us in?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Richele"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1032_excu2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_931_1#7$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "A warning, first: no running off like that woman\u2013",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Raimund"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
