    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh no! Hurry, s-someone!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cl\u00e9ment"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_931_1#6$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Cl\u00e9ment? What's wrong? What happened?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Raimund"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_924_1#11$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thank goodness, Raimund! Let the others know\u2013",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cl\u00e9ment"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1032_excu2_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "A raid?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_924_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah, that's right! Err, Raimund, who are these two?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cl\u00e9ment"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_931_1#7$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't worry about them! What's going on?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Raimund"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_924_1#11$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, r-right... It's terrible!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cl\u00e9ment"
    },
    {
        "text": "I was repairing the windows just now, when I saw something moving in the distance\u2013",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cl\u00e9ment"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_924_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The band of robbers from before! They're back!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cl\u00e9ment"
